window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>The odyssey is almost over.</p> <p>Charlie Rhodes started out as an intern hiding in the one place they were looking for her.</p> <p>Now she’s a powerful hybrid who is about to learn all the secrets of her past.</p> <p>The war is here. Is the happily ever after right behind?</p> <p>This three-book omnibus includes <i>The Alien Anomaly, The Rougarou Rigmarole, </i>and <i>The Grim Reaper Gaffe.</i></p>"; 
